    <fields>
        <fullName>TR1__Scale_By_Master_Skill_Type__c</fullName>
        <deprecated>false</deprecated>
        <description>This setting allows to override scale depending on a Master Skill Type value in the Match Query.</description>
        <fieldManageability>SubscriberControlled</fieldManageability>
        <inlineHelpText>Specify the Importance of each Master Skill Type in the Match Query. API names of Skill Types should be used. For skills without type (Non-Normalised ) &quot;Other&quot; should be used. Scale values can be set to “STRONGLY_FAVORED”, “FAVORED” or “REQUIRED”. If value is not specified, the value from the Skill Filter JSON Schema setting will be used. Example: 
{
&quot;IT_Skill&quot; : &quot;FAVORED&quot;&quot;,
